{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to defy gravity on a neon-lit hoverboard track suspended in space?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play up to 4 players and race against your friends while you trying to\u00a0 control a physics-based hoverboard. The Hovaria is challenging you to master speed, balance, and precision. Every turn is sharp, and every mistake might send you flying into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just racing\u2014you're adapting.<br>Each track is built inside a massive cyberpunk-style space station, full of glowing lights, sudden drops, and deadly curves. With no rails to hold you and no second chances, every race becomes a test of instinct and control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-driven hoverboard mechanics</strong> \u2013 Feel the weight, momentum, and impact of every movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 player online races</strong> \u2013 Go head-to-head with friends or other players in tight, skill-based matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish cyberpunk environments</strong> \u2013 Race through glowing tunnels and anti-grav drops in a visually striking space station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No safety nets</strong> \u2013 One wrong move and you\u2019re off the track. Stay sharp, ride hard.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762950?t=1755883096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762950?t=1755883096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762950/ed38fea6eef248b66bd846bdc1c0856bc01efb06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755883096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762950/ed38fea6eef248b66bd846bdc1c0856bc01efb06/capsule_184x69.jpg